# ElPlay agent rules

Read `MEMORY.md` and `AGENTS.md` before coding.

## Zero

- One product: **ElPlay**. No v1/v2 naming.
- Expo **SDK 54** docs: https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v54.0.0/
- Code/comments/commits/schema: **English**. UI: **Spanish** only via `src/i18n/es.ts`.

## Structure

- Thin routes in `src/app/`
- Domain in `src/features/<name>/`
- Tokens in `src/theme/` — never hardcode colors/spacing
- Follow `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` boundaries

## Access

- Guest entry without registration is first-class
- Primary auth is **Google** (Supabase OAuth); no email/password wall for MVP

## Domain

- Game types: league | tournament | internal
- Internal stats never mix with official; internal never on public live
- KO / mercy on half-inning close; hierarchy league → tournament → game
- Default 7 innings unless league overrides

## Quality

- No `any`. Zod at boundaries. Type guards over `as`.
- Handle Supabase `error` explicitly. Clean up Realtime channels.
- RLS is the source of authz.
- Active part only (see MEMORY). Respect Trello assignees (Partner / Contributor).
- Before done: `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, tests when present.
- UX: ballpark scoreboard feel; thumb-first; no generic SaaS entry screens.
